{"message":"Your $450 monthly interest is roughly consistent with a 5.5% APY on an average balance of about $96,000: approximately $425–$450 for a 30-day month, depending on daily balances and compounding. Gold Savings earns 5.5% APY and compounds daily.

You may also qualify for additional APY bonuses through certain checking-account pairings or eligible credit cards. Checking bonuses do not stack; only the highest applicable checking bonus is used. Credit-card bonuses likewise depend on the card and eligibility.

I can review your specific Gold Savings rate, checking accounts, and cards to confirm whether the correct bonuses are being applied. Please provide your full name so I can locate your profile. I’ll then verify your identity before accessing account details."}
